--- !u!114 &7395818005600869643
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: Now that VirtualGrasp can access the geometrical mesh data of
      objects, we extract this data in the form of .obj files that are exported into
      a local <b>vg_tmp</b> folder. <br/> For upload purpose, the content of vg_tmp
      folder will be packaged into a .zip file in your project root folder (by default
      <b>grasps.zip</b>).
--- !u!114 &8186699638067521352
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 456c7c2b477e4253b9e4faf9ed4b18a9, type: 3}
  m_Name: InstructionsParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.InstructionsParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Title:
    m_Untranslated: Export Geometrical Data for your Objects
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "To pass this step, create a <b>grasps.zip</b> package: <br/>
      Select the GameObject that contains your VG_MainScript component. <br/> Open
      the <b>MyVirtualGrasp\u2192Debug Settings</b> section and enable <b>Export
      scene in Runtime. Start and Stop</b> the scene once.\n\nAlternatively, you
      can click <b>Export Scene in Editor,</b> but be aware that objects that do
      not exist in your offline scene, but only in runtime (such as dynamically spawned
      objects), will not be considered."
  m_CriteriaCompletion: 0
  m_Criteria:
    m_Items:
    - Type:
        m_TypeName: Unity.Tutorials.Editor.ArbitraryCriterion, Unity.Tutorials.Editor,
          Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null
      Criterion: {fileID: -3551011484789677998}
--- !u!114 &8445472050871139125
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: <b>VG_Articulation</b> is the component that makes a GameObject
      visible to VirtualGrasp, thus marks it as interactable. <br/> A VG_Articulation
      can be placed on any object that has a <b>MeshRenderer</b> assigned to it.<br/>
--- !u!114 &8525136461697344037
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 456c7c2b477e4253b9e4faf9ed4b18a9, type: 3}
  m_Name: InstructionsParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.InstructionsParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Title:
    m_Untranslated: Use the Grasp Baking Client to prepare your Upload
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "To pass this step, create a bake package for upload. By default,
      it will be placed under <b>grasps.zip:</b>\n\nSelect <b>VirtualGrasp \u2192
      Bake Grasps</b> in the menu. \n\nIf this is your first time, enter the credentials
      that you have received when <a href=\"https://www.virtualgrasp.com/download\">registering
      for VirtualGrasp</a> in the <b>Login</b> tab and verify them.\n\nClick <b>Package</b>
      to create a <b>bake-job.zip</b> file from the content in your <b>vg_tmp</b>
      folder.\n\nIf you cannot continue, click <b>Export</b> once more to update
      the content in your <b>vg_tmp</b> folder.\n"
  m_CriteriaCompletion: 0
